BaseVault_tryDepositToAdapter
├── when the caller is not the vault itself
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__OnlySelf
├── when the caller is the vault itself
│   ├── it should transfer USDC to the adapter
│   └── it should call deposit on the adapter
└── when the adapter deposit reverts
    ├── it should revert
    ├── it should not leave USDC on the adapter
    └── it should leave USDC in the vault
